    "text": "Let $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}5 & 5 \\alpha & \\alpha \\\\ 0 & \\alpha & 5 \\alpha \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{array}\\right]$. If $|\\mathrm{A}|^2=25$, then $|\\alpha|$ equals to",
