    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\n5 & 5 \\alpha & \\alpha \\\\\n0 & \\alpha & 5 \\alpha \\\\\n0 & 0 & 5\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\n& |A|=5(5 \\alpha)-5 \\alpha(0)+\\alpha(0)\n\\end{aligned}$\n$|A|=25 \\alpha \\quad \\Rightarrow|A|^2=625 \\alpha^2=25 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\alpha^2=\\frac{1}{25} \\quad \\Rightarrow|\\alpha|=\\frac{1}{5}$",
